WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.073
In 1944,

2
00:00:01.073 --> 00:00:03.648
delegates met at Bretton Woods,

3
00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:05.634
in the United States.

4
00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:07.678
They designed the world's economic

5
00:00:07.678 --> 00:00:08.613
order.

6
00:00:08.943 --> 00:00:11.555
Bretton Woods created the IMF

7
00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:13.524
and the World Bank in

8
00:00:13.524 --> 00:00:17.252
1944. GATT followed in 1947.

9
00:00:17.252 --> 00:00:20.395
The WTO replaced GATT in

10
00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.573
1995.

11
00:00:21.923 --> 00:00:22.933
In 1974,

12
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:25.786
developing countries won a UN

13
00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:28.421
declaration calling for a New

14
00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:30.816
International Economic Order.

15
00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:33.585
The debates today: IMF voting

16
00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:36.087
shares, and the WTO's stalled

17
00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:37.734
Appellate Body.

18
00:00:38.064 --> 00:00:39.335
Your turn.

19
00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:41.339
When did the WTO replace

20
00:00:41.339 --> 00:00:42.308
GATT?
